    "body": "🤘🏼\n\nOn Fri, Sep 6, 2019 at 5:47 AM Albin Ekblom <notifications@github.com>\nwrote:\n\n> I use starship modules to set my tab titles, it would be nice if I could\n> disable colors via CLI too.\n>\n> function __strip_color\n>     echo (string replace -ra '\\e\\[[^m]*m' '' $argv[1])\n> end\n>\n> function fish_title\n>     echo (__strip_color (string split \" \" (starship module directory))[2])\n> end\n>\n> —\n> You are receiving this because you were mentioned.\n> Reply to this email directly, view it on GitHub\n> <https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/208?email_source=notifications&email_token=AACITB5LXFRSFC7YCGR4RV3QIIRLXA5CNFSM4INXOBSKYY3PNVWWK3TUL52HS4DFVREXG43VMVBW63LNMVXHJKTDN5WW2ZLOORPWSZGOD6CLCXA#issuecomment-528789852>,\n> or mute the thread\n> <https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/AACITB5VA5YARFSCZURZ27LQIIRLXANCNFSM4INXOBSA>\n> .\n>\n\n\n-- \nOak.Works\n\nSteve Ross\n[O] (912) 268-0444\n\n[M] (912) 344-8113\n",
