    "updated_at": "2020-01-07T02:41:07Z",
    "body": "@steve-ross To clear a module's styling, add the following line to `~/.config/starship.toml`:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# Clear the styling of the directory module\r\ndirectory.style = \"\"\r\n```",
